# Deprecated: manual overlay

**Do not copy this file.** `agent-utils-reuse init` now installs:

- **`.cursor/rules/project-agent-gate.mdc`** — `alwaysApply: true` for **any** project
- Package-managed rules/hooks refreshed on **every** `init` (not only `--force`)

To merge the same bullets into **your** project core rule (e.g. `my-agent-core.mdc`):

1. Add to `.utils-bookrc.json`:

```json
"projectAgentCoreRule": ".cursor/rules/my-agent-core.mdc"
```

2. Run `pnpm agent-utils-reuse init --force`

See `templates/snippets/project-agent-gate.inject.md` in the npm package.
